    "short_description": "Mia Faircroft\u2019s adventures continue in The Heir of Glen Kinnoch! In this classic Hidden Object Game, search through bright and beautiful locations, restore priceless antiques in exciting minigames, and uncover who will inherit Castle MacDougal.",
